  "name": "review-from-recording",
  "description": "Review a recorded review session by transcribing audio.wav, events.jsonl, edit.snapshot.json, and session.json using analyze-footage's same 3-layer STT. Segment utterances, resolve references from the interaction trace, normalize imperative instructions, and produce open review.json annotations plus a compilation report. Use to turn spoken QA sessions into tickets, compile recorded/transcribed sessions, or explicitly recompile compiled sessions. Also triggered by requests like \"レビューの録音 s-0003 を文字起こしして、コメントにまとめて\" or \"Transcribe review recording s-0003 and turn it into comments\".（旧名: compile-review-session）",
